              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 20:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "calu Musa jatic pa Yehova ng’olo ni nyithindho mir Israel, calu egore i kitabu mi cik pa Musa, pemblam mi kidi ma jutong’o ngo, ma ng’atu moko mbe ma foduting’o nyunyu i wie: man githiero lam m’awang’a i wie ni Yehova, man gilamu lam mi kwiocwiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man egoro keca wi kidi wagi cik pa Musa, ma yang’ egoro, i vut njdthindho mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
