            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.11+DEU.27.12+DEU.27.13+DEU.27.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27:11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Israel ceke, ku judongo migi ku jego, man jupoklembe migi, gicungo i ng’et sanduk kucel man i ng’ete kucel i wang’ julam ma Julawi, m’uyeyo sanduk mi lembariba pa Yehova, en e jabedo calu ng’atu ma junyolo thugi; ng’etgi kurucel i nyim got Gerizim, man ng’etgi kurucel i wang’ got Ebal; calu Musa ma jatic pa Yehova ng’olo ku kwong’a, nia gimi mugisa ni nyithindho mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man yo ng’eye esomo lembe mi cik ceke, mugisa ku kwong’, calku gin ceke m’ugore i kitabu mi cik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembe acel de mbe m’udong’ i kind lembe ceke ma Musa ng’olo, ma Yocuwa kusomo ngo i wang’ udul ceke piir Israel, ku mon, man nyithindho ma thindho, man jubedo ma gini i kindgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.35",
